WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.428 --> 00:00:03.928
(siren wails)

00:00:09.439 --> 00:00:10.770
- [Interviewer] All right, Tameka.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.130
Tameka, where are you from originally?

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.740
Where did you grow up?

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.860
- Well I grew up a lot
of different places.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.610
I was in placement for a long time.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:24.000
So, like, I grew up in
L.A. and Long Beach.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.850
And like...

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.160
- [Interviewer] Southern California?

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.560
- Yeah, the high desert too.

00:00:30.294 --> 00:00:31.704
- [Interviewer] Tell me about your family.

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:32.780
Did you have both your parents as a kid?

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.860
- No. I just met my dad like

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.320
six months ago.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.600
Or something like that.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.510
And my mom been dead since I was six.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.100
- [Interviewer] You
lost your mom early on?

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.580
- Yeah, she been dead for like 20 years.

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:46.570
- [Interviewer] Who raised you?

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.400
- First, my aunty and then

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.800
I went back into the system.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:54.580
I was in group homes and
foster homes and stuff.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.810
- [Interviewer] How would
you describe your childhood?

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:57.643
- I mean,

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:00.160
It was different.

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:02.830
Like no parents and shit.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.450
It's whatever though.

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:07.240
- [Interviewer] Any abuse or
anything traumatic happen?

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:09.220
- No. I just was

00:01:11.673 --> 00:01:12.506
I don't know

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.440
you know, different I guess.

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:17.823
- [Interviewer] Okay.

00:01:19.795 --> 00:01:22.230
And you went on your own at what age, 18?

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:26.430
- Yeah, 18, but I got
pregnant at 18 though.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:27.263
So

00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:29.067
I was like

00:01:32.636 --> 00:01:34.136
I was still in the foster home

00:01:36.363 --> 00:01:39.310
I was like damn, I'm about
to have a baby and shit.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.530
So I tried to like, you
know, do shit different.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.370
Do shit right, you know.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.870
But that shit didn't last for long.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.920
Then I had two more kids

00:01:50.211 --> 00:01:51.130
and it was just too much.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.530
It was hectic like.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.420
- [Interviewer] So you
have three children?

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.253
- Yeah.

00:01:56.253 --> 00:01:57.086
- [Interviewer] Are you raising them?

00:01:57.086 --> 00:01:57.919
- They live with their dad.

00:01:57.919 --> 00:01:59.350
- [Interviewer] They live with dad?

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.460
Do you still see them?

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:01.293
- Yeah I see them.

00:02:01.293 --> 00:02:02.310
- [Interviewer] You do? Good.

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:07.390
- But you know, like his
mom, she don't like me.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.830
So, they don't be cool like that.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:11.529
They be trippin' and stuff.

00:02:11.529 --> 00:02:12.530
I be like you know,

00:02:14.336 --> 00:02:15.336
I be ready to fight.

00:02:17.022 --> 00:02:17.940
Cause it's wrong.

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:25.690
So, I don't know.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:27.620
I just don't, I don't got

00:02:29.091 --> 00:02:30.930
I don't got no job or nothing, shit.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:31.763
What the fuck.

00:02:31.763 --> 00:02:33.560
What else I'm supposed to do, you know?

00:02:36.502 --> 00:02:37.352
I don't know, so.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:42.200
I just was like, fuck it.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.370
My homegirl was telling me some shit like

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.970
you could just get money
like this you know?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.170
And I'm like shit, fuck
it, let's get money.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:53.160
So, I just been getting money ever since.

00:02:54.143 --> 00:02:56.730
I don't see no

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.630
I don't know.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.730
I'd be willing to work and stuff but like,

00:03:00.804 --> 00:03:02.800
shit don't happen like that.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.270
Especially

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.720
with people like me.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.790
- [Interviewer] Did
you finish high school?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.910
- No.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.700
Cause I mean, I got pregnant.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.480
I tried to go but then it got hectic

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.560
and I couldn't find
nobody to watch my baby.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.380
And I was pregnant too.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.250
Already had a baby and I was pregnant..

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.020
You know, so

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.510
I just stopped going.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.650
- [Interviewer] You started
working the street at what age?

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.483
- When I was 18.

00:03:31.483 --> 00:03:32.530
- [Interviewer] 18.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.363
- Yeah.

00:03:33.363 --> 00:03:35.030
- [Interviewer] Did you work
with a pimp or on your own?

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.170
- My homegirl told me about it.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.520
And I just, I never

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.940
I always try to stay away from pimps.

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:45.660
I got kidnapped before, but

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.800
shit that shit was crazy.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.810
I didn't think they was
really out here like

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.690
kidnapping bitches and shit.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.170
That shit was so crazy.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.070
Shit was scary but

00:03:58.676 --> 00:04:00.670
I still gotta get money, feel me?

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.820
I just try to be a
little bit more careful.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.540
- [Interviewer] It's a dangerous
way to make money, right?

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:09.240
- Yeah it is, but hey.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.360
People be going to war with guns and stuff

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:17.120
so like that's dangerous
way to make a living too.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.180
- [Interviewer] Have you
had some bad experiences?

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.550
- Besides getting kidnapped,

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:24.020
no, not really.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.150
I kinda just like

00:04:26.221 --> 00:04:30.680
I don't know, I'll be like
two seconds from danger

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:31.670
I'll be fine and I'll like

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:34.450
Oh, I coulda just been
right there, you know.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:35.650
For something to happen.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.260
I seen a lot of shit though.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.340
I don't do that shit.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.050
That shit is crazy out here like.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.173
Man.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.000
You don't even know.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.410
Cause you know, to see it and to live it

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:52.630
is two different things, you know.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.720
- [Interviewer] What's the
craziest thing you've seen?

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:57.900
- The craziest thing I seen?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.680
- [Interviewer] Well, you
avoided the terrible stuff

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.460
but I'm sure you've
probably seen some stuff?

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.290
- Yeah, like I've avoided a lot.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.940
I was with my friend one time

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:10.850
and she was like let's go
with this guy or whatever.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:13.380
And I was like, hell no,

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.190
I am not going with that motherfucker.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.530
You shouldn't go either.

00:05:19.623 --> 00:05:22.650
I don't know, she got
stabbed up and stuff.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.350
Like a gang of shit.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.110
And I was like damn.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:29.020
I felt bad, but I told
this bitch not to go.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.570
That's crazy. People is crazy.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:33.400
I was scared though cause
I coulda been right there.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.800
I was just right there with her, you know.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.030
That shit was, ooh.

00:05:36.899 --> 00:05:39.390
I was like man, that shit is crazy.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:41.370
I was like damn, you know.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.300
Cause if I had went, who knows, you know?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.570
- [Interviewer] You have
to use your intuition.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.450
- Hell yeah.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.510
Ya better.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.400
- [Interviewer] How many
customers do you just say

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.422
