00:05:52.422 --> 00:05:54.505
(laughs)

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:57.280
- Yeah, like lately, like a lot.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.200
People's been crazy out here.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.033
I don't know.

00:06:00.912 --> 00:06:02.900
I been trying to work off the internet.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.073
- [Interviewer] I'm sorry?

00:06:05.073 --> 00:06:07.120
- I been trying to like
work off the internet.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:07.970
Like on Facebook.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.600
Whatever.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.023
- [Interviewer] Have you
been arrested before?

00:06:12.023 --> 00:06:12.910
- Yeah.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.230
I been arrested here, and Las Vegas.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.230
Gang of times in Las Vegas.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.890
- [Interviewer] So you go
to Vegas sometimes too?

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:22.753
- Yeah.

00:06:22.753 --> 00:06:23.810
- [Interviewer] Do you
make more money there?

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:24.643
- Yeah.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:27.690
But I mean, I make a lot of money so.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.720
- [Interviewer] What
do you make in a night?

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:33.210
- Like anywhere from eight to twelve.

00:06:35.148 --> 00:06:35.981
I be makin' money.

00:06:35.981 --> 00:06:38.050
- [Interviewer] And you'll
work what hours roughly?

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.490
- Really like the night

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.160
cause I like the night.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.560
- [Interviewer] So you start at what time?

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.860
- At like seven.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:44.880
- [Interviewer] Until what time?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.713
- Until five.

00:06:49.502 --> 00:06:51.270
- [Interviewer] And the guys
you'll pick up will be drunk?

00:06:52.364 --> 00:06:55.570
- I don't really like to
do it with drunk people.

00:06:59.291 --> 00:07:00.124
