00:07:26.709 --> 00:07:28.120
- [Interviewer] I mean
eventually they'll be old enough

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.670
to figure out what Mom's doing?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.630
- Hopefully like I'd have made it by then.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.640
And I ain't gonna...

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.590
- [Interviewer] You'll have made it out?

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.260
- Yeah and I ain't gotta.

00:07:38.823 --> 00:07:41.920
They ain't gotta know that.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.820
- [Interviewer] Are drugs
part of the picture for you?

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:46.180
- No, I tried to pop pills before

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.540
but drugs, no.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.990
I smoke weed though a lot.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.380
- [Interviewer] And you've
not worked with pimps?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:57.023
- No, I just try to stay away from pimps.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.550
Especially after I got kidnapped.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.010
Shit is crazy. Fuck that.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:05.813
- [Interviewer] Does this lifestyle

00:08:05.813 --> 00:08:06.820
