00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.080
- [Tameka] Hell yeah, all the time.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.050
I drink a lot.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:10.883
- [Interviewer] You drink a lot?

00:08:10.883 --> 00:08:12.199
- [Tameka] Yeah.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.560
