00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.920
- [Interviewer] Are you saving money?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:23.930
- [Tameka] I'm trying.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.990
- [Interviewer] You spend
it as fast as you make it?

00:08:28.102 --> 00:08:31.110
- [Tameka] I been working on that.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.060
- [Interviewer] I've talked
to a lot of the girls

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.040
