00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.630
but I would say like

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.330
it's a little bit more than recreation.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.543
- [Interviewer] What do you think

00:08:47.543 --> 00:08:48.920
most people don't understand about

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.940
girls that do this for a living?

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.350
- [Tameka] I mean, cause they don't know.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.510
What it's like to have nothing.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.720
Like absolutely nothing.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.680
Oh, what I'm gonna do? Nothing?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:01.513
Like nothing?

00:09:01.513 --> 00:09:03.200
You know what I'm saying?

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.171
I didn't have nothing.

00:09:05.171 --> 00:09:07.310
Don't even think about
it cause you got nothing.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.620
You know what I'm saying?

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:09.620
And people don't know that shit.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.860
They don't know what that shit feel like.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.260
They don't have a lot
to say on how they feel

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.940
I should be or she should be

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:18.360
or whoever should be

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.400
when they don't even know.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.380
Cause if they knew, they
wouldn't even say that.

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:23.950
I know they wouldn't say that

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:26.060
cause I wouldn't say that.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:27.220
And I know.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:29.020
- [Interviewer] When your
back's against the wall?

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.960
- [Tameka] Yeah, you
know, that's crazy but

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.440
