00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.490
It becomes an option.

00:09:37.109 --> 00:09:38.590
What was the best time of your life?

00:09:40.306 --> 00:09:42.871
- I think when my oldest son was born.

00:09:42.871 --> 00:09:44.331
Yeah.

00:09:44.331 --> 00:09:45.640
I was happy.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.490
I was real happy.

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:49.320
- [Interviewer] And
what was the worst time?

