00:10:11.573 --> 00:10:12.406
a different life for yourself?

00:10:12.406 --> 00:10:13.370
- Hell yeah.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:16.290
I always knew where I was gonna be.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.130
When I was younger as a kid.

00:10:20.761 --> 00:10:21.594
I don't know.

00:10:21.594 --> 00:10:24.690
I wanted to be like a journalist and shit.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.230
All kind of shit.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:30.770
