00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:31.603
it was like,

00:10:33.871 --> 00:10:35.010
it was for real.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.790
- [Interviewer] Well but
you're still very young too.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:38.623
