- I hope so.

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:42.820
Yeah, I really hope so.

00:11:44.374 --> 00:11:45.250
- [Interviewer] What
do you think would help

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.650
a girl in your situation?

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:47.500
To make a change?

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:49.713
- A lot.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:52.773
Stability.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.670
Really, that's the main thing.

00:12:03.956 --> 00:12:05.310
